  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> (Area outside the parabola)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> (Area inside the circle)<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/077351ca-2423-446a-ab6d-23e14bf655c4-image.png\" style=\"width: 260px; height: 219px;\" /><br />Finding point of intersection of the curves, we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br />Coordinates of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> only area above <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis&nbsp;would be considered.</p><p>Hence, area<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></munderover><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></munderover><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></munderover><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></munderover><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sq</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>units</mi></math>&nbsp;</p>",
